# Used by `gcloud run deploy --source` INSTEAD OF .gitignore.
# This file is essential: .gitignore excludes *.db, which would strip the
# validation database the image bakes in. Here we upload only what the build
# needs — and we explicitly keep verdict_experiment.db*.
*

!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!ui/
!ui/**
!verdict_experiment.db
!verdict_experiment.db-wal
!verdict_experiment.db-shm

# trim things under ui/ that the server doesn't need
ui/__pycache__/
ui/VerdictUI.html
ui/VerdictUI.jsx
